{
  "revision": 1,
  "purpose": "Human crew conversations; clear evidence-to-destination links; authored16-bit comic pages.",
  "scenes": {
    "opening": [
      {
        "who": "CAPTION",
        "text": "For years, Earth had been at peace.",
        "kind": "wide",
        "art": "city",
        "id": "OPENING-01",
        "duration": 2.61,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "CAPTION",
        "text": "Fury Division trained in secret. The best pilots from around the world, waiting for a call they hoped would never come.",
        "kind": "wide",
        "bank": "hq-conference",
        "hold": 0,
        "id": "OPENING-02",
        "duration": 6.73,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "Last check, Deck. Then you eat.",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "id": "OPENING-03",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "Hold on. I'm getting orders I didn't send.",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "id": "OPENING-04",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "It's everywhere. Roads, power stations, defense.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "city-takeover",
        "cue": "stage3AtomicSiren",
        "cueAt": 0.1,
        "id": "OPENING-05",
        "duration": 2.6,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "FALVA",
        "text": "Hangar door nearly took Lizzie's head off.",
        "people": [
          "falva",
          "lizzie"
        ],
        "id": "OPENING-06",
        "duration": 2.61,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "LIZZIE",
        "text": "I'm fine. Worry about the planes.",
        "people": [
          "falva",
          "lizzie"
        ],
        "id": "OPENING-07",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "Cut the uplinks. We fly by hand.",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "id": "OPENING-08",
        "duration": 2.61,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "Already cut. Our jets are clear.",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "id": "OPENING-09",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "AXEL",
        "text": "Freezer. On me.",
        "people": [
          "axel",
          "freezer"
        ],
        "id": "OPENING-10",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "FREEZER",
        "text": "Right behind you.",
        "people": [
          "axel",
          "freezer"
        ],
        "id": "OPENING-11",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "YURI",
        "text": "Those people down there don't have wings.",
        "people": [
          "yuri",
          "cole"
        ],
        "id": "OPENING-12",
        "duration": 2.61,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "That's why we're going.",
        "people": [
          "yuri",
          "cole"
        ],
        "id": "OPENING-13",
        "duration": 1.77,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "MAVERICK",
        "text": "And here I was getting bored.",
        "people": [
          "maverick",
          "juggernaut"
        ],
        "id": "OPENING-14",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "JUGGERNAUT",
        "text": "I'll get the doors. Get everybody out.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "juggernaut-help",
        "people": [
          "juggernaut",
          "maverick"
        ],
        "id": "OPENING-15",
        "duration": 2.61,
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "Fury flight. Talk to me.",
        "kind": "travel",
        "art": "sky",
        "cue": "jetDash",
        "cueAt": 0.1,
        "id": "OPENING-16",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Lost the squad. Still flying. Where do you need me?",
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ],
        "cue": "crackle",
        "cueAt": 0.1,
        "id": "OPENING-17",
        "duration": 3.49,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "Keep those things away from the towns. We'll find you.",
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ],
        "id": "OPENING-18",
        "duration": 3.49,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      }
    ],
    "post-1": [
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "That's one down. Tell me somebody heard that.",
        "id": "B101",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "I heard you. And something else is answering.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "radar-acquisition",
        "cue": "blip",
        "id": "POST1-02",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Where?",
        "id": "POST1-03",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "The volcanic belt. Same orders, over and over.",
        "id": "POST1-04",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Then we've got somewhere to start.",
        "kind": "travel",
        "art": "sky",
        "id": "POST1-05",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "post-2": [
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Come on, $techName. Pick up.",
        "id": "B201",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "There you are! I thought we'd lost you.",
        "cue": "crackle",
        "id": "POST2-02",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "You can yell at me when I'm home. What is this thing?",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "service-connector",
        "id": "POST2-03",
        "duration": 4.08,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "A service port. Plug in the recorder. Keep it off the network.",
        "id": "POST2-04",
        "duration": 4.08,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "Got it. The next relay's in the ice field.",
        "id": "POST2-05",
        "duration": 3.2,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "I've got a fire rig ready. Those ice tanks won't like it.",
        "upgrade": 2,
        "id": "POST2-06",
        "duration": 4.08,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Good. I could use something on my side.",
        "id": "POST2-07",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "Get out of there. The ground is moving.",
        "kind": "travel",
        "art": "sky",
        "cue": "crackle",
        "id": "POST2-08",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "post-3": [
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "All right. We're home. What did we bring back?",
        "id": "B301",
        "kind": "wide",
        "bank": "hq-conference",
        "hold": 0,
        "tag": "briefing",
        "duration": 3.2,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "The relay's recorder. Every machine heard the same voice.",
        "tag": "briefing",
        "id": "POST3-02",
        "duration": 3.2,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "Whose?",
        "tag": "briefing",
        "id": "POST3-03",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "I don't know yet. There's a launch record in here. Same signal. It came from the airfield east of us.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "launch-correlation",
        "tag": "briefing",
        "id": "POST3-04",
        "duration": 6.43,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "LIZZIE",
        "text": "So we go to the airfield.",
        "people": [
          "lizzie",
          "falva"
        ],
        "tag": "briefing",
        "id": "POST3-05",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "I also need its backup power cell. Without it, we don't get above the atmosphere.",
        "tag": "briefing",
        "id": "POST3-06",
        "duration": 4.96,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "AXEL",
        "text": "I'll take point.",
        "people": [
          "axel",
          "freezer"
        ],
        "tag": "briefing",
        "id": "POST3-07",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "FREEZER",
        "text": "Then I'll watch your tail.",
        "people": [
          "axel",
          "freezer"
        ],
        "tag": "briefing",
        "id": "POST3-08",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "MAVERICK",
        "text": "Try to leave something for the rest of us.",
        "people": [
          "maverick",
          "juggernaut"
        ],
        "tag": "briefing",
        "id": "POST3-09",
        "duration": 3.2,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "JUGGERNAUT",
        "text": "Everybody gets home. That's the deal.",
        "people": [
          "maverick",
          "juggernaut"
        ],
        "tag": "briefing",
        "id": "POST3-10",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "That's the deal.",
        "kind": "wide",
        "bank": "hq-conference",
        "hold": 3,
        "tag": "briefing",
        "id": "POST3-11",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "The ice core's safe. I'll see what we can use before you leave.",
        "upgrade": 3,
        "id": "POST3-12",
        "duration": 4.37,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "CAPTION",
        "text": "A few minutes later. Decker's workshop.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "hq-laser-reveal",
        "hold": 0,
        "tag": "prototypes",
        "id": "POST3-13",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "You moved the coil.",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "tag": "prototypes",
        "id": "POST3-14",
        "duration": 1.73,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "Thought you'd spot that. Watch this.",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "tag": "prototypes",
        "id": "POST3-15",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "SYSTEM",
        "text": "",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "hq-laser-demo",
        "duration": 2.1,
        "action": "laser-test",
        "tag": "prototypes",
        "id": "POST3-16",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "That's your Photon Cannon?",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "tag": "prototypes",
        "id": "POST3-17",
        "duration": 1.87,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "Ours. You wound half the coils.",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "tag": "prototypes",
        "id": "POST3-18",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "Come here, you lunatic.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "hq-cole-decker-hug",
        "tag": "prototypes",
        "id": "POST3-19",
        "duration": 1.77,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "Easy! Still need those ribs.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "hq-cole-decker-hug",
        "hold": 5,
        "tag": "prototypes",
        "id": "POST3-20",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "When can I fly it?",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "tag": "prototypes",
        "id": "POST3-21",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "When it stops melting the stand. Bring me that power cell.",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "tag": "prototypes",
        "id": "POST3-22",
        "duration": 3.79,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "You've got it.",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "tag": "prototypes",
        "id": "POST3-23",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      }
    ],
    "arrival-4": [
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "There's the airfield. The launch pad's still lit.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "airbase-arrival",
        "id": "A401",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Get the records. Get the cell. Get home.",
        "kind": "travel",
        "art": "sky",
        "id": "ARRIVAL4-02",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "post-4": [
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Got your power cell. And the launch camera's recorder.",
        "id": "B401",
        "duration": 3.2,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "All right. Show me what happened.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "decker-reaction",
        "hold": 0,
        "id": "POST4-02",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "SYSTEM",
        "text": "",
        "id": "B403",
        "kind": "wide",
        "bank": "satellite-takeover",
        "duration": 3.3,
        "action": "satellite",
        "cue": "crackle",
        "cueAt": 0.4,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "It got inside the satellite.",
        "id": "POST4-04",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "Symbiote code. It used the downlink to reach everything down here.",
        "id": "POST4-05",
        "duration": 3.79,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "So we cut it off.",
        "id": "POST4-06",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "Your space kits are ready. Just don't make me come get you.",
        "upgrade": 4,
        "id": "POST4-07",
        "duration": 4.08,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "FALVA",
        "text": "We got Granddad's bomber flying. We can handle this.",
        "people": [
          "falva",
          "lizzie"
        ],
        "id": "POST4-08",
        "duration": 3.2,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "LIZZIE",
        "text": "Granddad's bomber had air outside it.",
        "people": [
          "falva",
          "lizzie"
        ],
        "id": "POST4-09",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "One last check. Then we're going up.",
        "kind": "travel",
        "art": "earth",
        "id": "POST4-10",
        "duration": 2.61,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "warp-5-9": [
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "That gate isn't on our charts.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "warp-drive-lock",
        "id": "W5901",
        "cue": "blip",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Can we clear it?",
        "id": "WARP59-02",
        "duration": 1.73,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "We're already through the last marker. Keep her straight!",
        "id": "WARP59-03",
        "duration": 3.2,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Everybody hang on.",
        "kind": "warp",
        "art": "space",
        "id": "W5903",
        "duration": 2.4,
        "cue": "warp",
        "cueAt": 0.25,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "arrival-9": [
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Everybody still in one piece?",
        "id": "A901",
        "kind": "travel",
        "art": "space",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "Ask me again when my hands stop shaking.",
        "id": "ARRIVAL9-02",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Let's find a way back.",
        "id": "ARRIVAL9-03",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "post-9": [
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "There's our way home. Take it while it's still open.",
        "id": "Q01",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "warp-drive-lock",
        "hold": 5,
        "duration": 3.49,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Gladly.",
        "id": "POST9-02",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "The recorder caught something useful. I'll see what I can make of it.",
        "upgrade": 9,
        "id": "POST9-03",
        "duration": 4.37,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "First, get us back.",
        "kind": "travel",
        "art": "space",
        "id": "POST9-04",
        "duration": 1.73,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "post-5": [
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "HQ, open the doors. We're coming home.",
        "id": "B501",
        "kind": "travel",
        "hold": 0,
        "art": "sky",
        "duration": 2.61,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "JUGGERNAUT",
        "text": "Hey. We all made it, right?",
        "people": [
          "juggernaut",
          "$pilot"
        ],
        "tag": "workshop",
        "id": "POST5-02",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "We did. Give me a hand with this thing.",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "juggernaut"
        ],
        "tag": "workshop",
        "id": "POST5-03",
        "duration": 3.2,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "You actually brought the gun back.",
        "id": "B503",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "hq-chaingun-inspection",
        "tag": "workshop",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "Nearly killed us. Figured it owed us something.",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "tag": "workshop",
        "id": "POST5-05",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "JUGGERNAUT",
        "text": "Can I have it?",
        "people": [
          "juggernaut",
          "decker"
        ],
        "tag": "workshop",
        "id": "POST5-06",
        "duration": 1.73,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "No.",
        "people": [
          "juggernaut",
          "decker"
        ],
        "tag": "workshop",
        "id": "POST5-07",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "JUGGERNAUT",
        "text": "Had to ask.",
        "people": [
          "juggernaut",
          "decker"
        ],
        "tag": "workshop",
        "id": "POST5-08",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "CAPTION",
        "text": "Later that night.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "hq-salvage-diagnostics",
        "duration": 2.2,
        "tag": "workshop",
        "id": "POST5-09",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "It works. I can fit the squad with these.",
        "upgrade": 5,
        "tag": "workshop",
        "id": "POST5-10",
        "duration": 3.2,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "Keep my rig as it is. Get everybody else ready.",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "tag": "workshop",
        "id": "POST5-11",
        "duration": 3.49,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "JUGGERNAUT",
        "text": "Now that's heavy metal.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "hq-heavy-metal",
        "tag": "workshop",
        "id": "POST5-12",
        "duration": 1.77,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "Cole. Come look at this.",
        "id": "B505",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "radar-acquisition",
        "action": "alarm",
        "cue": "stage3AtomicSiren",
        "cueAt": 1.0,
        "duration": 2.02,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "How many?",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "id": "POST5-14",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "Too many. They're coming down on the city.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "radar-acquisition",
        "hold": 5,
        "id": "POST5-15",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "[Guard names], hold the base. Everyone else, with me.",
        "id": "POST5-16",
        "duration": 3.2,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "On your wing.",
        "id": "B507",
        "kind": "travel",
        "art": "sky",
        "cue": "jetDash",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "post-6": [
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "$routeReport",
        "id": "B601",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "Everybody answer me. Need to hear your voices.",
        "id": "POST6-02",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "FREEZER",
        "text": "Still here.",
        "people": [
          "axel",
          "freezer"
        ],
        "id": "POST6-03",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "But the orders haven't stopped.",
        "id": "POST6-04",
        "duration": 2.03,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "We took out the carrier.",
        "id": "POST6-05",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "It was passing them along. Something below the city is still talking.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "subsurface-search",
        "id": "POST6-06",
        "duration": 4.08,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "YURI",
        "text": "Under that bridge?",
        "people": [
          "yuri",
          "$tech"
        ],
        "id": "POST6-07",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "In the drains. Look.",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "river-arrival",
        "hold": 3,
        "id": "POST6-08",
        "duration": 1.73,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Mark the other contacts. We'll deal with them if we have to.",
        "id": "POST6-09",
        "duration": 4.08,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "Check your gear before you go under. I don't like how narrow that looks.",
        "upgrade": 6,
        "id": "POST6-10",
        "duration": 4.67,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Keep talking to me. All the way in.",
        "kind": "travel",
        "art": "river-arrival",
        "id": "POST6-11",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "arrival-7": [
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "Low under the bridge. There's your entrance.",
        "id": "A701",
        "kind": "wide",
        "bank": "river-arrival",
        "hold": 5,
        "duration": 2.61,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "I see it. Going in.",
        "id": "ARRIVAL7-02",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "post-7": [
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "It's opening something.",
        "id": "B701",
        "kind": "portal",
        "art": "sewer",
        "duration": 1.77,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "Back out. I can't see what's on the other side.",
        "id": "POST7-02",
        "duration": 3.49,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "That's where the orders are coming from.",
        "id": "POST7-03",
        "duration": 2.61,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "Then take me with you. Keep this line open.",
        "id": "POST7-04",
        "duration": 3.2,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Don't go quiet on me.",
        "kind": "portal",
        "art": "sewer",
        "id": "POST7-05",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "ending": [
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "$techName? Anybody?",
        "id": "E01",
        "kind": "wide",
        "bank": "city-takeover",
        "hold": 0,
        "duration": 1.65,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "I'm here.",
        "id": "ENDING-02",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Is it over?",
        "id": "ENDING-03",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "TECH",
        "text": "The machines have stopped. All of them.",
        "id": "ENDING-04",
        "duration": 2.61,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "PILOT",
        "text": "Then let's go home.",
        "kind": "travel",
        "art": "earth",
        "id": "ENDING-05",
        "duration": 1.73,
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "Fury flight. Talk to me.",
        "kind": "wide",
        "bank": "hq-conference",
        "hold": 3,
        "id": "ENDING-06",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "AXEL",
        "text": "Axel. Home.",
        "people": [
          "axel",
          "freezer"
        ],
        "id": "ENDING-07",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "FREEZER",
        "text": "Freezer. Still on his wing.",
        "people": [
          "axel",
          "freezer"
        ],
        "id": "ENDING-08",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "YURI",
        "text": "Yuri. I should call my parents.",
        "people": [
          "yuri",
          "cole"
        ],
        "id": "ENDING-09",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "Tell them you did good.",
        "people": [
          "yuri",
          "cole"
        ],
        "id": "ENDING-10",
        "duration": 2.02,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "FALVA",
        "text": "Mom is going to have questions.",
        "people": [
          "falva",
          "lizzie"
        ],
        "id": "ENDING-11",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "LIZZIE",
        "text": "You answer them. I'm going to sleep.",
        "people": [
          "falva",
          "lizzie"
        ],
        "id": "ENDING-12",
        "duration": 2.61,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "MAVERICK",
        "text": "Maverick. You can stop worrying now.",
        "people": [
          "maverick",
          "cole"
        ],
        "id": "ENDING-13",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "DECKER",
        "text": "Decker. Before you ask, the coffee's gone cold.",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "id": "ENDING-14",
        "duration": 2.9,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "COLE",
        "text": "I'll live.",
        "people": [
          "cole",
          "decker"
        ],
        "id": "ENDING-15",
        "duration": 1.65,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "JUGGERNAUT",
        "text": "Juggernaut. I've got a song for this.",
        "kind": "wide",
        "bank": "juggernaut-guitar",
        "id": "ENDING-16",
        "duration": 2.61,
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "FREEZER",
        "text": "Does it have a volume knob?",
        "people": [
          "freezer",
          "juggernaut"
        ],
        "id": "ENDING-17",
        "duration": 2.31,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 0
      },
      {
        "who": "JUGGERNAUT",
        "text": "Not one I use.",
        "people": [
          "freezer",
          "juggernaut"
        ],
        "id": "ENDING-18",
        "duration": 1.73,
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "style": 1
      },
      {
        "who": "CAPTION",
        "text": "Everybody home.",
        "kind": "wide",
        "bank": "hq-conference",
        "hold": 3,
        "duration": 2.5,
        "id": "ENDING-19",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "sting": [
      {
        "who": "CAPTION",
        "text": "Far from Earth, a receiver wakes.",
        "kind": "wide",
        "art": "space",
        "duration": 2.8,
        "id": "STING-01",
        "style": 0,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      },
      {
        "who": "SYSTEM",
        "text": "",
        "kind": "insert",
        "bank": "radar-acquisition",
        "hold": 2,
        "duration": 2.2,
        "cue": "blip",
        "cueAt": 1.2,
        "id": "STING-02",
        "style": 1,
        "people": [
          "$pilot",
          "$tech"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "voices": {
    "cole": "Calm, direct, observant. Checks on people before equipment. Knows Decker's work well enough to spot a moved coil.",
    "decker": "Clever and practical, with dry humor. Explains what a discovery means; never narrates menus or speaks in diagnostic labels.",
    "yuri": "Russian-American, raised in America after his parents fled with him at four during Cold War tensions. No fake accent. Notices the civilians beneath the fight.",
    "axel": "The experienced air-force commander. Short, dependable calls. Trusts Freezer without needing to say so.",
    "freezer": "Axel's former wingman and close friend. Relaxed, dry, loyal. A joke relieves pressure rather than erasing danger.",
    "falva": "American sister in pink, glasses, practical confidence. She and Lizzie learned together while repairing their late WWII-pilot grandfather's bomber, encouraged by their mother.",
    "lizzie": "American sister in yellow, hoop earrings, no glasses. Warm and blunt. Her answers ground Falva's confidence in what is actually happening.",
    "maverick": "Teal, green aviators, hired gun who chose Cole's team. Arrogant enough to joke, loyal enough to stay; never cruel to the crew.",
    "juggernaut": "Huge tattooed pilot in an open dark vest. A protective teddy bear with a thrash/progressive-metal habit. Strength and warmth first, jokes second."
  },
  "continuity": [
    "Earth begins at peace; Fury Division is a secret elite international pilot program.",
    "The networked machinery turns hostile. Decker cuts the jets' receivers; manual/local control explains why Fury can still fly.",
    "The first repeating orders lead to the volcanic belt, then the ice relay. A recovered recorder points to the launch airfield.",
    "The airfield's launch camera shows symbiote code taking over a satellite. Its backup power cell makes the orbital refit possible.",
    "The Photon Cannon is a bench prototype. Its demonstration grants no weapon tier. Earned equipment and every pilot's actual progression remain native.",
    "Maverick's homing lasers stay fixed. Do not promise him elemental or chaingun conversions.",
    "The eight-gate warp is optional and keeps its real return to Stage5. The two Stage6 outcomes retain their separate surviving contacts and optional pursuit.",
    "The city battle exposes a source in the drains, the Warden's breach leads to Dracodia, and defeating him stops the orders.",
    "Pilot/co-op selections retain their actual names, aircraft, colors, guard assignments and continuation. A crew conversation never changes a save, reward or combat rule."
  ]
}